  "_note": "CD4093 Quad 2-input Schmitt-trigger NAND gate. Pin table per TI CD4093B datasheet (SCHS053). CMOS equivalent of 74HC132 — same 14-pin DIP pinout, CMOS voltage levels. DIP-14 package. Same pinout as 74HC00 (1A/1B/1Y, 2A/2B/2Y, 3A/3B/3Y, 4A/4B/4Y) — extractors alias to NAND logic. GND=pin 7, VCC=pin 14. Used in Wilson-primer SBC builds for address decode with hysteresis.",
